OL,3,GNEWSACinema fighting for future
OL,4,Ashortlisted as UK's best
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the UK's oldest independent
OL,7,Fcinemas has been shortlisted for a
OL,8,Fprestigious award recognising the best
OL,9,Fin the country.
OL,11,FOn Tuesday, the Ultimate Picture Palace
OL,12,F(UPP) in Oxford was revealed as one of
OL,13,Ffive nominees for the 2026 Cinema of
OL,14,Fthe Year award at the British
OL,15,FIndependent Film Awards (BIFA).
OL,17,FMore than 70 cinemas across the country
OL,18,Fentered the competition, with nearly
OL,19,F50,000 votes cast by cinemagoers.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
