OL,3,GNEWSACinema fighting for future
OL,4,Ashortlisted as UK's best
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UPP was first founded in 1911 and
OL,7,Fis one of the UK's oldest purpose-built
OL,8,Fcinemas, but the nomination comes as it
OL,9,Ffights for its long-term future.
